== Notes ==
* The icon of the D infinity will change to resemble the corresponding die while being held. Putting it back on a pedestal will change its icon back to normal.
* {{dlc+|r}} When in possession of more than one active item with the {{I|Schoolbag}}, all dice must be cycled through before the other active item can be used.
** When playing as {{C|Tainted Isaac}} and holding D infinity as well as another active item via {{I|Schoolbag}}, if {{I|Schoolbag}} is replaced by another passive item in its slot while the other active item is held, {{I|D infinity}} will be dropped on the ground, reset to its original state. This could allow the player to use any dice item with only a 2-pip charge.{{dlc-}}
* {{dlc+|r}} This item can be crafted from {{i|Bag of Crafting}} with eight {{p|Dice Shard||Dice Shards}}.{{dlc-}}

== Synergies ==
* {{Book of Virtues synergy|description=Spawns a normal wisp in addition to having an extra effect based on the current die selected.}}

== Interactions ==
* {{i|Car Battery|nr}}:  Activates 2 dice. The second activation die cannot be predicted.
** {{dlc|r}} The second activation die is determined by the seed and never changes.
* {{i|Void|nr}}: When absorbed and Void is used, replicates the effect of a random die item.
** {{dlc|r}} Acts as a copy of one of the 10 dice D infinity can replicate. This die is randomly chosen and does not change.
* {{p|? Card|r}}: Activates the selected die, updating the charge time and keeping the charges stored.

